n","name":"QOU.QBeta.PhiBProdFactorAnalytic.analyticOnNhd_numFactor","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/PhiBProdFactorAnalytic.lean#L32-L45","doc":"**Each numerator factor `1 + q^{2k+1} e^{2πbz}` is entire**: a constant plus the\nexponential of an affine function of `z`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}